{"v":1,"accession":"PRJEB6366","title":"Age-related microRNAs profiling in rat brains using deep sequencing","description":"This study has identified 171 novel miRNA candidates in rat brains, making evaluation of the full regulating mechanism for age-related genes or pathways feasible. This study has also revealed that age is a critical regulator for miRNA expression, and the age-related decline of miRNA expression is not a progressive process, but rather a biphasic one. Age-regulated miRNAs are predicted to target genes involving in nodes of signalling pathways relevant to brain aging and neurodegenerative diseases.","center":"HUNAN NORMAL UNIVERSITY","data_type":"Other","submission_date":"2014/07/22 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMEA2547925","DNA sample from Saliva of a human male participant in the dbGaP study \"Resource for Genetic Epidemiology Research on Aging (GERA)\"","non_environmental",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"host-derived or clinical material"],["SAMEA2547926","DNA sample from Saliva of a human male participant in the dbGaP study \"Resource for Genetic Epidemiology Research on Aging (GERA)\"","non_environmental",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"host-derived or clinical material"],["SAMEA2547927","DNA sample from Saliva of a human female participant in the dbGaP study \"Resource for Genetic Epidemiology Research on Aging (GERA)\"","non_environmental",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"host-derived or clinical material"],["SAMEA2547928","DNA sample from Saliva of a human male participant in the dbGaP study \"Resource for Genetic Epidemiology Resear